/// occurredAt, serverRevision, createdAt, updatedAt, mediaDurationSeconds}`
/// class, no `freezed` (mirrors `AuthenticatedUser`: this feature has no
/// need for the union/copyWith machinery `Failure` uses). Boundaries:
